        mid: ['Fill in the table: units per 1 g, and for pitchblende and the chalcolite from the mine also how many times stronger than uranium.', 'Which sample gave the most units? Does that mean it is the strongest? Why do we have to work out units per 1 gram?', 'Chalcolite from the mine and chalcolite made by Marie are the same substance. Which one is more active? What does that mean?'],
